      "versionNonce": 419149284,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WHAT THE SYNC TELLS YOU\n\nAt the end of step 2 you get a list:\n\n[  ]   still only ours\n[ ~ ]  production started building it\n[ ! ]  production HAS it now\n\nA  [ ! ]  means we're maintaining\nsomething twice by accident.\nThat's the one to act on.",
      "originalText": "WHAT THE SYNC TELLS YOU\n\nAt the end of step 2 you get a list:\n\n[  ]   still only ours\n[ ~ ]  production started building it\n[ ! ]  production HAS it now\n\nA  [ ! ]  means we're maintaining\nsomething twice by accident.\nThat's the one to act on.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "rectangle-169562586",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
