      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "IF YOU GET STUCK\n\nNothing here is permanent.\nA branch you don't merge changes\nnothing at all. main stays exactly\nas it was.\n\nThat's the point of a branch.",
      "originalText": "IF YOU GET STUCK\n\nNothing here is permanent.\nA branch you don't merge changes\nnothing at all. main stays exactly\nas it was.\n\nThat's the point of a branch.",
